      <h2>Service Description</h2>

      <h3>What MomentCast provides</h3>
      <p>MomentCast provides Streamers with the tools to create and manage live streaming events, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>A private event page with a unique URL for sharing with viewers</li>
        <li>RTMPS streaming credentials compatible with standard broadcasting software</li>
        <li>A branded viewer experience with customizable cover photos, logos, and QR codes</li>
        <li>Automatic recording of live streams</li>
        <li>Replay availability for viewers after the event ends</li>
        <li>A streamer dashboard for managing events, viewing analytics, and purchasing credits</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>What MomentCast does not provide</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>MomentCast does not provide cameras, microphones, encoders, or internet connectivity. Streamers are responsible for their own broadcasting equipment and internet access.</li>
        <li>MomentCast does not guarantee a minimum number of viewers for any event.</li>
        <li>MomentCast is not a production company, videography service, or event planner.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

