      <h3>Availability</h3>
      <p>We strive to maintain high availability for all MomentCast services. However, we do not guarantee uninterrupted, error-free, or continuously available service. The Platform may be temporarily unavailable due to maintenance, updates, or circumstances beyond our control.</p>

      <h3>Viewing hour limits</h3>
      <p>Each credit includes a defined allocation of viewing hours. When an event's cumulative viewing hours reach the allocated limit, new viewers may not be able to join the stream. Existing viewers already watching will not be disconnected. Streamers can add more viewing hours at any time by applying additional credits from their account balance.</p>

