      <p>Deletion is permanent and cannot be undone. We delete your account, events, recordings, logo, cover images, and email subscription. We keep payment records processed by Stripe, and a transaction history that is no longer linked to your account, for as long as tax, accounting, and legal obligations require. Recordings are also subject to the retention periods in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

